  "details": "the addition of anticheat to vrchat is just about the most disappointing turns for the worse i've seen for VR as a whole. This needs to be a platform where people are *encouraged* to tinker, not banned for it! especially when most mods simply add features to vr chat the official devs can't always develop in a timely manner, I'm gonna cancel my subscription until this hopefully gets reversed, because honestly this seems like the first step to ending up like minecraft (where you can now be banned for saying nono words in 18+ servers)",
